{"speciesId":291,"names":{"fr":"Ninjask","es":"Ninjask","en":"Ninjask","ja":"テッカニン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"NINJASK moves around at such a high speed that it cannot be seen, even while its crying can be clearly heard. For that reason, this POKéMON was long believed to be invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"If NINJASK is not trained properly, it will refuse to obey the TRAINER and cry loudly continuously. Because of this quality, this POKéMON is said to be one that puts the TRAINER’s abilities to the test."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Because it darts about vigorously at high speed, it is very difficult to see. Hearing its distinctive cries for too long induces a headache."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"This POKéMON is so quick, it is said to be able to avoid any attack. It loves to feed on tree sap."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"This POKéMON is so quick, it is said to be able to avoid any attack. It loves to feed on tree sap."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its cry leaves a lasting headache if heard for too long. It moves so quickly that it is almost invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its cry leaves a lasting headache if heard for too long. It moves so quickly that it is almost invisible."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il bouge si vite que l’œil a parfois du mal à le suivre. Ils se regroupent près de la sève des arbres."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il bouge si vite que l’œil a parfois du mal à le suivre. Ils se regroupent près de la sève des arbres."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"C’est la migraine assurée quand il pousse son cri perçant. On le perd facilement de vue tant il est vif."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Escuchar su zumbido de forma continuada provoca jaquecas. Casi no se le ve de lo rápido que es."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its cry leaves a lasting headache if heard for too long. It moves so quickly that it is almost invisible."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"鳴き声を 聞き続けると 頭痛が 治まらなくなる。 見えない ほどの 速さで 動く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il bouge si vite que l’œil a parfois du mal à le suivre. Les Pokémon de cette espèce se regroupent près de la sève des arbres."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se mueve tan rápido que a veces resulta invisible. Le atrae la savia de los árboles."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"あまりに 高速で 動くため 姿が 見えなくなる ことがある。 樹液に 集まってくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ninjask se déplace tellement vite qu’il est impossible de le voir. En revanche, on entend clairement son cri. On a pendant très longtemps cru que ce Pokémon était invisible."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ninjask se mueve de un lado a otro a tal velocidad que es imposible verlo. Sin embargo, como su zumbido no deja de oírse, se pensó durante mucho tiempo que este Pokémon era invisible."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ninjask moves around at such a high speed that it cannot be seen, even while its crying can be clearly heard. For that reason, this Pokémon was long believed to be invisible."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"高速で 動き回り 姿が 見えない。 鳴き声しか 聞こえて こないので 長い間 透明な ポケモンと 考えられていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Si Ninjask n’est pas dressé correctement, il refuse d’obéir à son Dresseur et crie sans arrêt. C’est pourquoi on dit que ce Pokémon peut réellement mettre son Dresseur à l’épreuve."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Si Ninjask no recibe un entrenamiento adecuado, desobedece a su Entrenador y empieza a dar zumbidos sin parar. Por ello, se dice que pone a prueba las habilidades de su Entrenador."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"If Ninjask is not trained properly, it will refuse to obey the Trainer and cry loudly continuously. Because of this quality, this Pokémon is said to be one that puts the Trainer’s abilities to the test."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"上手に 育てないと いうことを 聞かず 大声で 鳴き続けるので トレーナーの 腕が 試される ポケモンと いわれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Une écoute prolongée de son cri provoque des maux de tête persistants. On le perd facilement de vue tant il est vif."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Escuchar su zumbido de forma continuada provoca jaquecas persistentes. Se mueve con tanta rapidez que es casi imposible verlo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its cry leaves a lasting headache if heard for too long. It moves so quickly that it is almost invisible."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"鳴き声を 聴き つづけると 頭痛が 治まらなくなる。 見えない ほどの 速さで 動く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon est tellement rapide qu’on le dit capable d’éviter toutes les attaques. Il adore se nourrir de la sève sucrée des arbres."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Este Pokémon es tan rápido que, según dicen, puede esquivar cualquier ataque. Le encanta alimentarse de la dulce savia de los árboles."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon is so quick, it is said to be able to avoid any attack. It loves to feed on tree sap."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"どんな 攻撃でも 避けてしまうと いわれるほど 素早い ポケモン。 甘い 樹液が 大好物。"}],"varieties":[{"id":291,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[5,"level-up",25],[6,"level-up",25],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",25],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",25],[8,"machine",0],[9,"level-up",25],[9,"machine",0],[10,"level-up",25],[10,"machine",0],[11,"level-up",25],[11,"machine",0],[12,"level-up",25],[13,"level-up",25],[14,"level-up",25],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",25],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",41],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",41],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",41],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",57],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",57],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",9],[6,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",9],[7,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",9],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",9],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",9],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",9],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",9],[12,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",9],[13,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",9],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",9],[15,"level-up",1],[